# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY for the tier-1 cloud path (Scenario 3).
#
# Uncomment the line below and paste your key after the "=". No quotes, no spaces
# around the "=", no "export" prefix - this is read by Node's process.loadEnvFile().
#
# It must be THIS FILE, not a session variable: start-elevated.ps1 uses RunAs, which
# spawns a process that does not inherit the session environment. A key exported in an
# ordinary shell never reaches the elevated app, and the demo silently degrades to
# tier-0 only.
#
# This file is gitignored. Do not commit a key.
#
# Confirm it worked: the app's startup log must read
#   [cloud] claude-haiku-4-5 ready (key from .env file)
# Anything else - especially "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY not set" - means Scenario 3 will not run.

#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
